            "A room made safer",
            "A weird object identified",
            "A quiet exit",
            "Somewhere to sit for a minute"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "House rules",
          "items": [
            "Consent first.",
            "Don't hand people back to systems they escaped.",
            "If it helps, it's legit.",
            "Keep the signal clean.",
            "Do not open 12 soul tabs."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Registry status",
          "items": [
            "Filed sideways.",
            "Returned twice.",
            "Approved by accident.",
            "Still valid."
          ]
